#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:4
msgid "E-book conversion"
msgstr "Konverzija e-knjiga"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:6
msgid ""
"calibre has a conversion system that is designed to be very easy to use. "
"Normally, you just add a book to calibre, click convert and calibre will try"
" hard to generate output that is as close as possible to the input. However,"
" calibre accepts a very large number of input formats, not all of which are "
"as suitable as others for conversion to e-books. In the case of such input "
"formats, or if you just want greater control over the conversion system, "
"calibre has a lot of options to fine tune the conversion process. Note "
"however that calibre's conversion system is not a substitute for a full "
"blown e-book editor. To edit e-books, I recommend first converting them to "
"EPUB or AZW3 using calibre and then using the :guilabel:`Edit book` feature "
"to get them into perfect shape. You can then use the edited e-book as input "
"for conversion into other formats in calibre."
msgstr ""
"calibre ima sistem za konverziju koji je jednostavan za korišćenje. Obično "
"je dovoljno da dodate knjigu, kliknete na dugme za konverziju i calibre će "
"pokušati da napravi izlaznu knjigu što sličniju originalu. Međutim, podržava"
" veliki broj ulaznih formata, od kojih neki nisu pogodni za pretvaranje u "
"e-knjige. Za takve formate, ili kada želite veću kontrolu, dostupne su "
"brojne opcije za podešavanje. Ipak, sistem za konverziju nije zamena za "
"namenski uređivač e-knjiga. Ako želite da uređujete knjigu, prvo je "
"pretvorite u EPUB ili AZW3, pa upotrebite funkciju :guilabel:`Uredi knjigu`."
" Tako uređenu knjigu možete koristiti kao polaznu tačku za konverziju u "
"druge formate."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:18
msgid ""
"This document will refer mainly to the conversion settings as found in the "
"conversion dialog, pictured below. All these settings are also available via"
" command line interface to conversion, documented at "
":doc:`generated/en/ebook-convert`. In calibre, you can obtain help on any "
"individual setting by holding your mouse over it, a tooltip will appear "
"describing the setting."
msgstr ""
"Ovde su prvenstveno opisana podešavanja u prozoru za konverziju, prikazanom "
"ispod. Sva su dostupna i preko komandne linije, opisane u "
":doc:`generated/sr@latin/ebook-convert`. Za pomoć u vezi s pojedinačnom "
"opcijom zadržite pokazivač miša nad njom; pojaviće se objašnjenje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:24
msgid "E-book conversion dialog"
msgstr "Dijalog za konverziju e-knjiga"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:31
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:95
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "Sadržaj"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:36
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:42
msgid ""
"The first thing to understand about the conversion system is that it is "
"designed as a pipeline. Schematically, it looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"Sistem konverzije radi kao niz uzastopnih koraka. Šematski izgleda ovako:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:45
msgid "The conversion pipeline"
msgstr "Koraci konverzije"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:49
msgid ""
"The input format is first converted to XHTML by the appropriate *Input "
"plugin*. This HTML is then *transformed*. In the last step, the processed "
"XHTML is converted to the specified output format by the appropriate *Output"
" plugin*. The results of the conversion can vary greatly, based on the input"
" format. Some formats convert much better than others. A list of the best "
"source formats for conversion is available :ref:`here <best-source-"
"formats>`."
msgstr ""
"Odgovarajući *ulazni dodatak* najpre pretvara izvorni format u XHTML. Zatim "
"se taj XHTML *obrađuje*. Na kraju *izlazni dodatak* pretvara obrađeni XHTML "
"u izabrani format. Rezultat zavisi od ulaznog formata: neki se pretvaraju "
"znatno bolje od drugih. Spisak najboljih polaznih formata nalazi se "
":ref:`ovde <best-source-formats>`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:56
msgid ""
"The transforms that act on the XHTML output are where all the work happens. "
"There are various transforms, for example, to insert book metadata as a page"
" at the start of the book, to detect chapter headings and automatically "
"create a Table of Contents, to proportionally adjust font sizes, et cetera. "
"It is important to remember that all the transforms act on the XHTML output "
"by the *Input plugin*, not on the input file itself. So, for example, if you"
" ask calibre to convert an RTF file to EPUB, it will first be converted to "
"XHTML internally, the various transforms will be applied to the XHTML and "
"then the *Output plugin* will create the EPUB file, automatically generating"
" all metadata, Table of Contents, et cetera."
msgstr ""
"Glavni posao obavljaju koraci koji obrađuju XHTML dobijen od *ulaznog "
"dodatka*. Oni, na primer, mogu da dodaju stranicu sa metapodacima na početak"
" knjige, prepoznaju naslove poglavlja, automatski naprave sadržaj i "
"proporcionalno prilagode veličinu slova. Važno je da se ti koraci primenjuju"
" na XHTML, a ne neposredno na izvornu datoteku. Pri pretvaranju RTF-a u "
"EPUB, calibre prvo pravi XHTML, zatim ga obrađuje, a *izlazni dodatak* na "
"kraju pravi EPUB sa metapodacima i sadržajem."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:65
msgid ""
"You can see this process in action by using the debug option |dbgi|. Just "
"specify the path to a folder for the debug output. During conversion, "
"calibre will place the XHTML generated by the various stages of the "
"conversion pipeline in different sub-folders. The four sub-folders are:"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj proces možete videti na delu koristeći opciju za otklanjanje grešaka "
"|dbgi|. Samo navedite putanju do fascikle za izlaz otklanjanja grešaka. "
"Tokom konverzije, calibre će smestiti XHTML generisan u različitim fazama "
"procesa konverzije u različite podfascikle. Četiri podfascikle su:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:38
msgid "Debug icon"
msgstr "Ikona za otklanjanje grešaka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/conversion.rst:70
msgid "Stages of the conversion pipeline"
msgstr "Faze procesa konverzije"

